{"5290910":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Sump","steam_appid":5290910,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intended to be completed in under 3 hours. What will you find? What will find you?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/4217405bd35dcf97da39cbfbeb080dd8.poster.avif?t=1793742329\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/4217405bd35dcf97da39cbfbeb080dd8.webm?t=1793742329\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/4217405bd35dcf97da39cbfbeb080dd8.mp4?t=1793742329\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend an impossible labyrinth<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can God's light reach this place? The only way out is through.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/c13bb23dd8008bffd4d73462fe33e435.poster.avif?t=1793742329\" aria-label=\"a light switch lever is turned on, illuminating a darked corridor. the lever is turned back off.\" width=1170 height=354 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/c13bb23dd8008bffd4d73462fe33e435.webm?t=1793742329\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/c13bb23dd8008bffd4d73462fe33e435.mp4?t=1793742329\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Operate the machine<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what can emerge from a limited mechanical framework. How can a shadow be so dark?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/1ce6e7292f2e431df5da3016dae9c28a.poster.avif?t=1793742329\" aria-label=\"a lever with a door icon is switched on. a sparkling effect moves towards a locked door, and unlocks it upon arrival.\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/1ce6e7292f2e431df5da3016dae9c28a.webm?t=1793742329\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/1ce6e7292f2e431df5da3016dae9c28a.mp4?t=1793742329\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain composure and you will descend. Find truth beyond the brick.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/eb933c1de80f4db17395b25bc7cb8b56.poster.avif?t=1793742329\" aria-label=\"a panicked run through narrow cistern corridors.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/eb933c1de80f4db17395b25bc7cb8b56.webm?t=1793742329\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5290910\/extras\/eb933c1de80f4db17395b25bc7cb8b56.mp4?t=1793742329\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run<\/strong><\/h2